# Analytics Instrumentation

- Reuse shared analytics packages and helpers instead of ad hoc event calls.
- Use consistent event naming and include only necessary metadata.
- Do not capture secrets or unnecessary personal data.
- Be explicit about whether an event is client-side, server-side, security-related, or business-operational.
- Tenant attribution must be correct and must never cross-contaminate reporting.
